      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "In most configurations, [`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) delivers full-resolution buffers that match the video dimensions of the capture device’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) property.",
      "normalizedSource": "In most configurations, [`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) delivers full-resolution buffers that match the video dimensions of the capture device’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) property.",
